378
00:31:51.142 --> 00:31:53.519
<font color="#808080">(ALL LAUGHING)</font>

379
00:31:53.544 --> 00:31:57.105
<i>'Twas Pirelli's Miracle Elixir.</i>

380
00:31:57.130 --> 00:31:58.973
<i>That's what did the trick, sir.</i>

381
00:31:58.998 --> 00:32:00.642
<i>True, sir, true.</i>

382
00:32:00.667 --> 00:32:04.279
<i>Was it quick, sir?
Did it in a tick, sir?</i>

383
00:32:04.304 --> 00:32:07.882
<i>Just like an elixir ought to do.</i>

384
00:32:07.907 --> 00:32:09.768
<i>How about a bottle, mister?</i>

385
00:32:09.793 --> 00:32:12.661
<i>Only costs a penny, guaranteed.</i>

386
00:32:15.031 --> 00:32:18.677
<i>Does Pirelli's stimulate
