390
00:32:24.141 --> 00:32:25.684
<i>Stimulating, isn't it?</i>

391
00:32:25.709 --> 00:32:27.620
<i>Soon you'll have to thin it.</i>

392
00:32:27.645 --> 00:32:29.522
