393
00:32:29.547 --> 00:32:31.289
<i>Pardon me, ma'am
what's that awful stench?</i>

394
00:32:31.314 --> 00:32:34.259
<i>Are we standing in an open trench?
Must be standing near an open trench!</i>

395
00:32:34.284 --> 00:32:38.263
<i>Pardon me, sir what's that awful stench?
Buy Pirelli's Miracle Elixir.</i>

396
00:32:38.288 --> 00:32:40.048
<i>Anything what's slick, sir.</i>

397
00:32:40.073 --> 00:32:41.884
<i>Soon sprouts curls.</i>

398
00:32:41.909 --> 00:32:43.752
<i>Try Pirelli's.</i>

399
00:32:43.777 --> 00:32:45.387
<i>When they see how thick, sir.</i>

400
00:32:45.412 --> 00:32:47.222
<i>You can have your pick, sir.</i>

401
00:32:47.247 --> 00:32:48.964
<i>Of the girls.</i>

402
00:32:49.116 --> 00:32:50.459
<i>Want to buy a bottle, missus?</i>

403
00:32:50.484 --> 00:32:51.977
<i>What is this?
What is this?</i>

404
00:32:52.002 --> 00:32:53.312
<i>Smells like piss.</i>

405
00:32:53.337 --> 00:32:54.980
<i>Smells like... Ew!</i>

406
00:32:55.005 --> 00:32:56.514
<i>Looks like piss!
Wouldn't touch it if I was you, dear!</i>

407
00:32:56.539 --> 00:32:58.317
<i>This is piss, piss with ink.</i>

408
00:32:58.342 --> 00:33:00.853
<i>Let Pirelli's activate your roots, sir!
Keep it off your boots, sir.</i>

409
00:33:00.878 --> 00:33:01.954
<i>Eats right through.</i>

410
00:33:01.979 --> 00:33:03.540
<i>Yes, get Pirelli's,
use a bottle of it.</i>

411
00:33:03.546 --> 00:33:04.622
<i>Ladies seem to love it.</i>

412
00:33:04.647 --> 00:33:06.758
<i>Flies do, too</i>

413
00:33:06.783 --> 00:33:07.983
<font color="#808080">(CROWD LAUGHING)</font>

414
00:33:09.386 --> 00:33:11.330
<i><font color="#808080">(IN ITALIAN ACCENT)</font>
I am Adolfo Pirelli.</i>

415
00:33:11.355 --> 00:33:12.398
<i>The king of the barbers.</i>

416
00:33:12.423 --> 00:33:13.499
<i>The barber of kings.</i>

417
00:33:13.524 --> 00:33:15.201
<i>E buon giorno, good day!</i>

418
00:33:15.226 --> 00:33:17.369
<i>I blow you a kiss!</i>

419
00:33:17.394 --> 00:33:21.607
<i>And I the so famous
Pirelli I wish-a to know-a.</i>

420
00:33:21.632 --> 00:33:24.617
<i>Who has-a the nerve-a to say.</i>

421
00:33:24.619 --> 00:33:26.902
<i>My elixir is piss.</i>

422
00:33:27.754 --> 00:33:29.939
<i>Who says this?</i>

423
00:33:32.610 --> 00:33:33.785
I do.

424
00:33:33.810 --> 00:33:35.804
<font color="#808080">(CROWD MURMURING)</font>

425
00:33:35.829 --> 00:33:39.774
I am Mr. Sweeney Todd
