429
00:33:50.994 --> 00:33:55.957
Furthermore,<i>Signor,</i>
<i>I have serviced no kings,</i>

430
00:33:55.982 --> 00:34:00.812
yet I wager that I can shave a cheek
with 10 times more dexterity,

431
00:34:00.837 --> 00:34:03.456
